			"notes": "Created an easy translation layer for already compiled babric mods to use ornithe.\nThis can be used as either an ornithe mod or launcher java agent\n\nTested against many mods and seems to work 100% of the time unless breaking changes in the new toolchain (like my mod starac just decimating certain functions in lwjgl) messes with it.\nTest mods that succeeded:\n- Accessory API\n- Aether\n- BHCreative\n- BetterF3\n- Cryonic Config\n- Glass Config API 3\n- HudTweaks\n- InventoryTweaks\n- MiscTweaks\n- QuickAdditions\n- Retro Commands\n- RetroConvert\n- Staráč\n- Station API\n- Third Person Fix\n- ZastavkaAPI"
		}
